cosmic-ext-applet-mounter (0.4.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add provider-specific Online directory preload settings and background
    preload engines for Google Drive, OneDrive, Box, and SMB.
  * Add Google Drive custom OAuth client support and asynchronous fast-list
    VFS refresh tracking.
  * Add bounded Box and SMB directory walks with SMB per-connection overrides.
  * Cancel preload work before unmount, repair, removal, and sleep cleanup.
  * Validate rclone remote access before mounting and improve multi-panel IPC.
  * Detect lingering FUSE endpoints and correct confirmed lazy-repair handling.
  * Refine Settings layout, tooltips, themed surfaces, and status placement.
  * Update screenshots, README, design documentation, and automated coverage.

 -- Urs Utzinger <uutzinger@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0700

